    "sentence_translations": [
      "(10) Old Guan Disappeared",
      "",
      "This Monday, Little Dong called, but Old Guan did not answer the phone.",
      "",
      "This Wednesday, Little Dong called, but Old Guan also did not answer the phone.",
      "",
      "",
      "Five days had passed, and Old Guan still had not answered the phone.",
      "",
      "Where has Old Guan gone? Is she sleeping? She doesn’t want to be friends with me anymore?",
      "She’s not living in that senior apartment anymore? Where … Where is she?",
      "Little Dong thought about this a lot. Five days had passed, and Old Guan still had not answered the phone.",
      "Little Dong did not know what to do. He was very unhappy. At this time, Dad returned home.",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Dad, Old Guan disappeared! What shall I do? What shall I do?”",
      "",
      "Dad asked, “Old Guan? Who is Old Guan?”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Old Guan is my friend, my good friend!",
      "She is 64 years old. She lives in a senior apartment. She has disappeared! What shall I do? What shall I do?”"
    ]
